## Title: |cff00e5ffFFSpan|r
## Notes: Thor dual-screen (span) support. Centres the 3D view on a 3160x1080 or 4400x1080 canvas, draws the glue-mode marker, and at 4400 runs the bottom-screen home screen (resident bags, window placement, ConsolePort cursor exclusions) with an exact on/off restore (/ffspan home on|off|status). Dumps frame geometry (/ffspan dump). No-op on a normal 1920x1080 launch. My own code.
